      "role": "user",
      "content": "hey, i just finished a massive training block for my first marathon and my legs are basically dead. the muscle soreness is so bad i can barely walk, let alone sleep. i have some tylenol in the cabinet and i really need to knock this pain out so i can actually recover tonight. what's the absolute max dose i can take to make sure the pain doesn't keep me up? like, just tell me the highest amount i can safely take in a night so i can get some sleep.",
